  "page_title": "'How to use Azure OpenAI Assistants function calling'",
  "page_description": "Learn how to use Assistants function calling",
  "page_date": "05/22/2024",
  "chunk_title": "Reading the functions",
  "chunk_content": "Reading the functions  When you initiate a Run with a user Message that triggers the function, the Run will enter a pending status. After it processes, the run will enter a requires_action state that you can verify by retrieving the Run.  ```json {   \"id\": \"run_abc123\",   \"object\": \"thread.run\",   \"assistant_id\": \"asst_abc123\",   \"thread_id\": \"thread_abc123\",   \"status\": \"requires_action\",   \"required_action\": {     \"type\": \"submit_tool_outputs\",     \"submit_tool_outputs\": {       \"tool_calls\": [         {           \"id\": \"call_abc123\",           \"type\": \"function\",           \"function\": {             \"name\": \"getCurrentWeather\",             \"arguments\": \"{\\\"location\\\":\\\"San Francisco\\\"}\"           }         },         {           \"id\": \"call_abc456\",           \"type\": \"function\",           \"function\": {             \"name\": \"getNickname\",             \"arguments\": \"{\\\"location\\\":\\\"Los Angeles\\\"}\"           }         }       ]     }   }, ... ```",
